Error [E1101]: `particles` cannot be moved while `left` is lent to a task in `g`
  --> tests/ui/taskgroup_lent_owner_moved.jet:10:19
    |
 10 |         n :: eat(^particles)
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a task.group joins its children at the end of the block, so `left` stays borrowed until `g` joins — changing `particles` now would race a running task or free memory it still reads
 Fix: do this after the `g` block ends, or give the task its own owned copy instead of a borrow
